I sit on a wall at Marine Drive.
The sea is very big.
I look towards the water.
A nice cool wind comes.
There are many people here.
Some people walk straight.
Some people look towards the sea.
I look to the left.
The road is very long.
The road curves round ahead.
I look to the right.
There are big buildings there.
I think about my journey.
How do I come here from home?
First the bus comes straight.
Then I turn right.
And I come walking towards the sea.
Now I understand this part of the city.
There is a map in my head now.
I feel very nice.
